1
00:00:00,639 --> 00:00:03,519
(Sheldon:)I lost a bet to Wolowitz.

2
00:00:04,476 --> 00:00:07,816
(Leonard:)-You're saying you talked to Penny?
-Yes.

3
00:00:07,980 --> 00:00:10,360
(Sheldon:)-Interesting.
-Hardly.

4
00:00:10,524 --> 00:00:11,854
(Sheldon:)Excuse me.

5
00:00:12,026 --> 00:00:13,946
(Sheldon:)Have I crossed
some sort of line again?

6
00:00:14,111 --> 00:00:15,611
(Leonard:)Little bit.

7
00:00:17,072 --> 00:00:18,572
(Howard:)Hmm.

8
00:00:22,828 --> 00:00:25,118
(Sheldon:)Oh. Who cares?

9
00:00:31,212 --> 00:00:33,882
(Penny:)-Oh, hey.
-Hey, what did Sheldon say to you?

10
00:00:34,089 --> 00:00:38,299
Not a lot. That we always have the
option of going back to being friends.

11
00:00:39,136 --> 00:00:41,596
(Leonard:)-Is that what you want?
-I don't know.

12
00:00:41,764 --> 00:00:43,304
(Penny:)I mean, you have to admit...

13
00:00:43,474 --> 00:00:46,224
(Penny:)...things seemed simpler
when we were just friends.

14
00:00:46,936 --> 00:00:48,106
(Leonard:)I guess.

15
00:00:48,604 --> 00:00:51,984
(Penny:)-It would take the pressure off.
-It would, wouldn't it?

16
00:00:53,108 --> 00:00:55,238
(Penny:)So we'll just be friends.

17
00:00:55,402 --> 00:00:57,822
(Leonard:)Good. Good.

18
00:00:58,697 --> 00:01:00,197
(Penny:)Come here.

19
00:01:06,455 --> 00:01:08,455
[BOTH MOANING]

20
00:01:12,962 --> 00:01:15,172
(Leonard:)Okay-dokay.

